# The genitive "nedelje" is the form "prošle/sledeće nedelje" ("last/next
# nedelje") uses -- and dictionaries give "last WEEK" as the DEFAULT gloss of
# that exact genitive (Wiktionary marks the weekday sense secondary at this
# case; sr.wikipedia treats nedelja/sedmica as interchangeable for "week").
# No source establishes one reading as dominant, so "prošle/sledeće nedelje"
# refuses rather than silently picking the weekday sense (see
# weekday_6.voc for the full disambiguation design).
nedelje
недеље
